WEBVTT

00:06.884 --> 00:11.264
<b>I can see it now. That's SPES's base.</b>

00:11.264 --> 00:14.514
<b>Where you say this Alicia girl is...</b>

00:14.514 --> 00:20.644
<b>Our goals are clear-cut:
Subduing Hel and rescuing Alicia.</b>

00:20.644 --> 00:22.854
<b>The fifth heart she harvested
as Jack the Ripper</b>

00:22.854 --> 00:27.274
<b>has most likely worn down by now
and is no longer functioning.</b>

00:27.274 --> 00:30.654
<b>In short, now is our best chance.</b>

00:30.654 --> 00:35.664
<b>Three years after our battle with
SPES began... this is finally it.</b>

00:35.664 --> 00:39.954
<b>Sidekick... Shall I stroke your head?</b>

00:39.954 --> 00:43.124
<b>What was the segue into that?</b>

00:43.124 --> 00:46.044
<b>Mom, I'm scared.</b>

00:46.044 --> 00:49.004
<b>You really are erratic in your moods.</b>

00:49.004 --> 00:50.254
<b>You don't want me to?</b>

00:50.254 --> 00:53.884
<b>Don't be silly. How could I do
something so embarrassing?</b>

00:57.264 --> 01:00.104
<b>Hmph. I'll give up my place.</b>

01:01.894 --> 01:04.024
<b>Come here.</b>

01:04.024 --> 01:07.104
<b>That's quite a dramatic pose
just to offer a head rub.</b>

01:07.104 --> 01:09.904
<b>We've got a little time,
so I thought I'd give you a hug.</b>

01:09.904 --> 01:14.154
<b>Don't try to press your chest against
a guy as if it's a commonplace thing.</b>

01:14.154 --> 01:16.904
<b>You have a unique way of
expressing things, Kimi.</b>

01:16.904 --> 01:20.994
<b>Okay, fine. Some other time, then.</b>

01:20.994 --> 01:23.664
<b>I doubt that time will come.</b>

01:29.214 --> 01:34.424
<b>Hey, you should've taken that hug from
Mom earlier, when you had the chance.</b>

01:34.424 --> 01:37.974
<b>That's silly. You think I could
do something so pathetic?</b>

01:37.974 --> 01:42.514
<b>You'll regret it if you keep being
so obstinate all the time,</b>

01:42.514 --> 01:45.434
<b>since you have nobody else besides Mom.</b>

01:45.434 --> 01:50.314
<b>That's not... And what's more, Siesta
has nobody else but me either, right?</b>

01:50.314 --> 01:51.694
<b>She doesn't.</b>

01:53.154 --> 01:56.494
<b>Mom doesn't have anyone but you.</b>

02:03.374 --> 02:07.234
From the very moment you caught my eye

02:03.374 --> 02:07.234
<b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>wo </b><b>mi</b><b>te</b><b>ta </b><b>a</b><b>no </b><b>hi </b><b>ka</b><b>ra</b>

02:07.414 --> 02:15.354
It felt like everything would change

02:07.414 --> 02:15.354
<b>su</b><b>be</b><b>te </b><b>ga </b><b></b><b>ka</b><b>wa</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>na </b><b>ki </b><b>ga </b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>ta</b>

