02:33.674 --> 02:37.394
Yet when I opened my eyes

02:33.674 --> 02:37.394
<b>me </b><b>wo </b><b>a</b><b>ke</b><b>re</b><b>ba </b><b>i</b><b>tsu</b><b>mo </b><b>to</b>

02:37.824 --> 02:42.824
You were missing, as always

02:37.824 --> 02:42.824
<b>o</b><b>na</b><b>ji </b><b>ta</b><b>da </b><b>hi</b><b>to</b><b>ri </b><b>ki</b><b>ta</b><b>i </b><b></b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>i</b><b>ta</b>

02:43.194 --> 02:47.044
You know, all those things I was unable to say

02:43.194 --> 02:47.044
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>ni </b><b></b><b>i</b><b>e</b><b>na</b><b>ka</b><b>t</b><b>ta </b><b>ko</b><b>to</b>

02:47.294 --> 02:51.884
Have remained bottled up to this day

02:47.294 --> 02:51.884
<b>i</b><b>ma </b><b>mo </b><b>to</b><b>ji</b><b>ko</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

02:53.144 --> 02:55.384
My heart is still searching

02:53.144 --> 02:55.384
<b>a</b><b>no </b><b>se</b><b>ka</b><b>i </b><b>de </b><b>mi</b><b>tsu</b><b>ke</b><b>ta</b>

02:55.524 --> 02:57.784
For that important thing

02:55.524 --> 02:57.784
<b>ta</b><b>i</b><b>se</b><b>tsu </b><b>na </b><b>na</b><b>ni</b><b>ka </b><b>wo</b>

02:58.044 --> 03:02.454
It discovered in that world.

02:58.044 --> 03:02.454
<b>ko</b><b>no </b><b>ko</b><b>ko</b><b>ro </b><b>wa </b><b>sa</b><b>ga</b><b>shi</b><b>mo</b><b>to</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

03:02.734 --> 03:05.434
Hey, I want us to always smile together

03:02.734 --> 03:05.434
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>zu</b><b>t</b><b>to </b><b>ko</b><b>ko </b><b>de </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>to</b>

03:05.654 --> 03:08.084
So right here and now

03:05.654 --> 03:08.084
<b>wa</b><b>ra</b><b>t</b><b>te </b><b>i</b><b>ra</b><b>re</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>ni</b>

03:08.364 --> 03:11.874
I'll make you a promise

03:08.364 --> 03:11.874
<b>ya</b><b>ku</b><b>so</b><b>ku </b><b>wo </b><b>su</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b>

03:13.514 --> 03:16.054
That will transcend time

03:13.514 --> 03:16.054
<b>to</b><b>ki </b><b>wo </b><b>ko</b><b>e</b><b>te, </b><b>i</b><b>ma</b>

03:32.044 --> 03:35.964
Episode 9

03:32.044 --> 03:35.964
Episode 9

03:38.884 --> 03:41.224
<b>There's nobody here.</b>

03:41.224 --> 03:45.054
<b>And here I was mentally prepared
for at least two or three fights.</b>

03:58.364 --> 03:59.694
<b>Wha--?</b>

04:06.704 --> 04:10.544
<b>What are these? Corpses?</b>

04:18.594 --> 04:22.594
<b>Cerberus? No, you're--</b>

04:22.594 --> 04:26.554
<b>Sadly for you, I am not Hel.</b>

04:30.604 --> 04:32.064
<b>Bat?</b>

04:32.064 --> 04:37.524
<b>Ooh, that's a great reaction!
But I'm not Bat either.</b>

04:37.524 --> 04:39.864
<b>Then who are you?</b>

04:42.284 --> 04:44.824
<b>I'm the parent.</b>

04:44.824 --> 04:47.534
<b>Wait, you're SPES's...</b>

04:47.534 --> 04:52.294
<b>A parent who wantonly kills his children--
your thinking is that of a monster.</b>

04:52.294 --> 04:59.344
<b>No. I am neither a person
nor a monster. I am "Seed."</b>

04:59.344 --> 05:02.674
<b>I'm a form of plant life that flew to
this star system from outer space.</b>

05:02.674 --> 05:04.014
<b>What?</b>

05:04.014 --> 05:05.934
<b>Though I say "plant,"</b>

05:05.934 --> 05:10.014
<b>that is only if I'm attempting to force us into
classifications as you humans describe them.</b>

05:10.014 --> 05:12.354
<b>Come on, give me a break.</b>

05:12.354 --> 05:17.024
<b>What in the world are you telling me
we've been fighting against?</b>

05:17.024 --> 05:19.734
<b>What are your intentions?</b>

05:19.734 --> 05:24.744
<b>Answer her, Seed. For what purpose
is SPES committing terrorist acts?</b>

05:25.824 --> 05:28.364
<b>It's for the purpose of surviving.</b>

05:29.704 --> 05:36.544
<b>Our intentions are to blanket this
planet with "seeds." Only that.</b>

05:40.084 --> 05:46.594
<b>The most primordial drive of living
things is to leave behind offspring.</b>

05:46.594 --> 05:52.684
<b>In birthing clones like this,
I wish for my seed to flourish.</b>

05:52.684 --> 05:57.314
<b>You think that motive makes it okay
to kill innocent human beings?</b>

05:57.314 --> 06:00.104
<b>What's the matter with
eliminating an alien species</b>

06:00.104 --> 06:03.984
<b>that stands in the way
of spreading our seed?</b>

06:03.984 --> 06:06.654
<b>You're the ones who are an alien species!</b>

06:08.914 --> 06:10.074
<b>Wha--?</b>

06:14.624 --> 06:21.084
<b>The "seeds" of my fallen brethren here
have now been taken in by that one.</b>

06:21.084 --> 06:24.344
<b>Hel, you mean? Where is Hel?</b>

06:24.344 --> 06:30.514
<b>She isn't here, which means there's only
one conceivable place she could be, no?</b>

06:30.514 --> 06:32.644
<b>Kimizuka, Mom!</b>

06:32.644 --> 06:35.814
<b>Right, I know. Hurry!</b>

06:46.034 --> 06:50.114
<b>It looks like I'll get
to have my fun, too.</b>

06:50.114 --> 06:53.284
<b>It can't be... Chameleon!</b>

07:01.964 --> 07:03.504
<b>Kimizuka!</b>

07:07.214 --> 07:09.724
<b>Let me ride behind you someday.</b>

07:16.724 --> 07:22.484
<b>He--Chameleon--said he'd get to
have his fun, <i>too</i>. Which means...</b>

07:22.484 --> 07:23.854
<b>Crap.</b>

07:36.784 --> 07:38.414
<b>Siesta!</b>

07:40.624 --> 07:42.584
<b>Stop playing around!</b>

07:42.584 --> 07:46.594
<b>You promised you wouldn't go off
and die without a word to us!</b>

07:46.594 --> 07:47.964
<b>Right?</b>

07:52.474 --> 07:54.724
<b>Forgive me.</b>

07:58.474 --> 08:02.734
<b>I never supposed you
would come here, Kimi.</b>

08:05.734 --> 08:08.984
<b>What a mess. My plan has gone awry.</b>

08:08.984 --> 08:14.454
<b>The root cause must be that your love
for me was deeper than I supposed.</b>

08:14.454 --> 08:18.954
<b>That said, Kimi,
performing first aid is fine,</b>

08:18.954 --> 08:23.714
<b>but normally, checking whether someone
is breathing on their own comes first.</b>

08:23.714 --> 08:27.134
<b>You... So your heart was beating
before I started?</b>

08:27.134 --> 08:29.424
<b>No, it wasn't beating, but--</b>

08:29.424 --> 08:31.594
<b>It was stopped?</b>

08:31.594 --> 08:34.884
<b>I've felt mildly outmatched
against Chameleon.</b>

08:34.884 --> 08:38.684
<b>Since it seemed like a hassle, I had
stopped my heart and was playing dead.</b>

08:38.684 --> 08:42.144
<b>Stopped... your heart?</b>

08:46.694 --> 08:48.944
<b>I'm only now asking after
three years together,</b>

08:48.944 --> 08:51.194
<b>but just what manner of person are you?</b>

08:51.194 --> 08:53.154
<b>Huh?</b>

08:53.154 --> 08:58.034
<b>Could it be you've gone weak in the
knees with relief, knowing I'm okay?</b>

08:59.164 --> 09:01.994
<b>Can I tell you my honest
feelings right now?</b>

09:01.994 --> 09:05.874
<b>No! Don't! I won't listen.</b>

09:05.874 --> 09:08.714
<b>I'm thinking you're very cute.</b>

09:08.714 --> 09:11.464
<b>Argh! I can't hear a thing!</b>

09:11.464 --> 09:14.804
<b>What to do... Shall I stroke
your head after all?</b>

09:14.804 --> 09:16.684
<b>I positively refuse!</b>

09:16.684 --> 09:17.724
<b>Shall I hug you?</b>

09:17.724 --> 09:19.644
<b>Not a chance.</b>

09:19.644 --> 09:22.354
<b>Or in Kimi-speak,
press my chest against you?</b>

09:22.354 --> 09:26.564
<b>Don't ever so casually try
doing this to any other guy!</b>

09:26.564 --> 09:30.064
<b>Oh, but you touched
my chest earlier already.</b>

09:30.064 --> 09:31.734
<b>This is absurd.</b>

09:31.734 --> 09:37.494
<b>Siesta, you've come into my life to
kill me, haven't you? Socially, that is.</b>

09:37.494 --> 09:40.874
<b>Teasing you is truly a pleasure, Kimi.</b>

09:43.044 --> 09:45.664
<b>It truly was a pleasure.</b>

09:47.504 --> 09:49.384
<b>Siesta...</b>

09:50.884 --> 09:55.634
<b>Maybe just once, comfort me
by holding me to your breast.</b>

09:58.264 --> 10:02.724
<b>If we survive to meet again
outside this island, that is. So...</b>

10:06.274 --> 10:09.064
<b>Which one are you?</b>

10:10.104 --> 10:14.284
<b>I think you can tell that
if you look at my form.</b>

10:14.284 --> 10:16.074
<b>Hel.</b>

10:17.744 --> 10:20.744
<b>So it looks like we can
consider you fully recovered.</b>

10:20.744 --> 10:25.374
<b>Uh-huh, thanks to Father. This time--</b>

10:25.374 --> 10:26.794
<b>I'll defeat you.</b>

10:26.794 --> 10:27.794
<b>Huh?</b>

10:27.794 --> 10:32.634
<b>And without fail,
I'll fulfill Alicia's wish.</b>

10:32.634 --> 10:39.264
<b>No, without fail you're going to die here.
You can't save that girl.</b>

10:52.694 --> 10:54.824
<b>You're so desperate it's laughable.</b>

10:54.824 --> 10:58.114
<b>You want that badly to
recover Her Ladyship, eh?</b>

10:58.114 --> 11:00.244
<b>Her Ladyship?</b>

11:00.244 --> 11:01.784
<b>Did you realize?</b>

11:01.784 --> 11:07.124
<b>This body is built a little differently
than those of the other SPES leaders.</b>

11:07.124 --> 11:12.884
<b>Originally it was ordinary, human.
But because of this body's peculiarity,</b>

11:12.884 --> 11:15.504
<b>it had a variety of experiments
performed on it...</b>

11:15.504 --> 11:20.224
<b>Pain, heat, pain, heat... torment.</b>

11:20.224 --> 11:24.894
<b>Apparently, Her Ladyship
suffered some very harsh trials.</b>

11:24.894 --> 11:28.644
<b>And then one day, when she could
no longer endure that agony,</b>

11:28.644 --> 11:32.024
<b>Her Ladyship brought me into being.</b>

11:32.024 --> 11:34.404
<b>So that's the story.</b>

11:34.404 --> 11:37.824
<b>A secondary secret personality
that Alicia generated</b>

11:37.824 --> 11:41.784
<b>when she couldn't stand the agony
anymore... that's what Hel is.</b>

11:41.784 --> 11:48.584
<b>Half in anguish, half in sorrow--
that's how we lived life.</b>

11:48.584 --> 11:55.044
<b>If that's the case, I'll end both the anguish
and the sorrow for you right now.</b>

12:02.474 --> 12:04.684
<b>Kimi... zuka...</b>

12:04.684 --> 12:05.604
<b>Alicia!</b>

12:05.604 --> 12:06.934
<b>Don't.</b>

12:10.644 --> 12:15.944
<b>If you'd shot me through the heart
or the head, you would've won.</b>

12:15.944 --> 12:18.904
<b>So Her Ladyship is that important to you.</b>

12:18.904 --> 12:24.324
<b>But such a soft-hearted bunch
won't defeat me.</b>

12:36.964 --> 12:38.924
<b>What is that?</b>

12:38.924 --> 12:41.174
<b>Well, we are in the enemy's stronghold.</b>

12:41.174 --> 12:45.434
<b>I see. You're saying even something
like this was within your expectations.</b>

12:45.434 --> 12:48.804
<b>This time I'll finish you!</b>

13:05.114 --> 13:06.994
<b>Sidekick, you're in the way.</b>

13:06.994 --> 13:09.164
<b>That's absurd.</b>

13:22.634 --> 13:26.054
<b>I'll kill you, and this time,</b>

13:26.054 --> 13:28.684
<b>I'll fulfill my mission
as a member of SPES!</b>

13:28.684 --> 13:31.814
<b>Ah. So it <i>was </i>a lie.</b>

13:34.394 --> 13:38.694
<b>What was? What about me
are you saying was a lie?</b>

13:38.694 --> 13:40.654
<b>That you're a wholly new being,</b>

13:40.654 --> 13:44.904
<b>brought into existence by
Alicia's self-protection instincts.</b>

13:44.904 --> 13:49.574
<b>The one who first took on SPES's
abilities and intentions was Alicia.</b>

13:49.574 --> 13:57.214
<b>So you were trying desperately to get
close to SPES. You're a mere impostor.</b>

14:03.674 --> 14:07.804
<b>To what purpose would I do that?</b>

14:07.804 --> 14:11.054
<b>What's the reason I've devoted
myself so entirely to SPES?</b>

14:11.054 --> 14:16.434
<b>Most likely you wanted
to be loved... by a father.</b>

14:16.434 --> 14:22.274
<b>You only wanted a father to love you.
You wanted someone to appreciate you.</b>

14:22.274 --> 14:23.404
<b>That was all.</b>

14:23.404 --> 14:28.154
<b>You're wrong! You're wrong!</b>

14:31.204 --> 14:37.584
<b>Earlier, your changing over to Alicia's
personality was to cause Alicia pain.</b>

14:37.584 --> 14:41.634
<b>That's because you were envious of Alicia.</b>

14:41.634 --> 14:42.884
<b>What are you saying?</b>

14:42.884 --> 14:45.344
<b>You brought yourself as much
suffering as you possibly could,</b>

14:45.344 --> 14:49.514
<b>yet you hated Alicia for finding
companions in Sidekick and me...</b>

14:49.514 --> 14:53.354
<b>Hated her and envied her.</b>

14:53.354 --> 14:54.974
<b>You're wrong!</b>

14:54.974 --> 14:58.064
<b>You're wrong! You're wrong! You're wrong!</b>

14:58.064 --> 15:02.944
<b>I'm not wrong. You only wanted to
be loved. You wanted companionship.</b>

15:02.944 --> 15:07.404
<b>Shut up! Kill one another.</b>

15:11.954 --> 15:15.994
<b>Siesta, you're not going to die.</b>

15:15.994 --> 15:19.164
<b>Sidekick, neither are you.</b>

15:21.874 --> 15:23.334
<b>Huh?</b>

15:30.174 --> 15:32.224
<b>How?</b>

15:32.224 --> 15:39.684
<b>It's simple. It's because I trust Sidekick
more than I trust anyone, even myself.</b>

15:39.684 --> 15:45.984
<b>We trust each other more than we trust
ourselves. That's all there is to it.</b>

15:45.984 --> 15:48.534
<b>What nonsense is that?</b>

15:48.534 --> 15:51.654
<b>You're saying because of something
like that my power doesn't work?</b>

15:51.654 --> 15:54.034
<b>Isn't that a little too
convenient for you?</b>

15:54.034 --> 15:56.584
<b>I'd ask you to at least
call it a spiritual bond.</b>

15:56.584 --> 16:01.254
<b>A spiritual bond? How can...?
How can such a thing...?</b>

16:01.254 --> 16:05.254
<b>Hel, you don't need to conform
to some Sacred Writ.</b>

16:05.254 --> 16:08.174
<b>You don't need to kill
any more people either.</b>

16:08.174 --> 16:11.134
<b>You can have companionship
without doing those things.</b>

16:11.134 --> 16:15.344
<b>Spiritual bonds come into being.
Thus, you don't need to force yourself</b>

16:15.344 --> 16:17.314
<b>to obey whatever he--
whatever Seed--tells you.</b>

16:17.314 --> 16:19.474
<b>So you say!</b>

16:19.474 --> 16:22.024
<b>I can't lose.</b>

16:22.024 --> 16:25.734
<b>I'll admit it: I wanted to be loved.</b>

16:25.734 --> 16:27.904
<b>I wanted to be needed.</b>

16:27.904 --> 16:31.114
<b>I wanted someone to acknowledge
that my being born meant something.</b>

16:31.114 --> 16:35.364
<b>It can't be just anybody, though.</b>

16:35.364 --> 16:41.204
<b>I live, fight, and lay ruin to the
world only for Father's sake.</b>

16:41.204 --> 16:44.924
<b>That's what my survival
instinct drives me to.</b>

16:44.924 --> 16:49.504
<b>Well and good. Shall we bring
this to a conclusion now?</b>

16:49.504 --> 16:51.884
<b>Let's end it here.</b>

16:59.314 --> 17:01.314
<b>What now?</b>

17:12.694 --> 17:14.204
<b>Sidekick!</b>

17:32.264 --> 17:33.974
<b>Mom...</b>

17:48.314 --> 17:54.154
<b>It was supposed to be confined to the lab;
maybe the scent of food lured it out?</b>

18:00.074 --> 18:01.494
<b>Siesta!</b>

18:04.914 --> 18:09.174
<b>I want you to not move for a moment.</b>

18:13.254 --> 18:16.094
<b>I've lost a little too much blood.</b>

18:21.304 --> 18:25.144
<b>I need to exchange it for a new one...</b>

18:29.274 --> 18:35.824
<b>Don't! If you want a heart,
I'll give you mine! Just don't...</b>

18:35.824 --> 18:38.614
<b>Just not Siesta!</b>

18:38.614 --> 18:43.744
<b>I told you before that you'd
become my partner someday.</b>

18:43.744 --> 18:48.544
<b>So we need to keep you alive, right?</b>

18:54.214 --> 18:58.884
<b>I'll take the legendary
detective's heart for myself.</b>

19:01.304 --> 19:06.394
<b>At last, I've acquired a heart
that's worthy of this body.</b>

19:06.394 --> 19:09.064
<b>With this, Father will certainly...</b>

19:11.524 --> 19:13.404
<b>Give it back.</b>

19:16.284 --> 19:21.864
<b>That heart belongs to Siesta.
You're going to give it back!</b>

19:21.864 --> 19:26.664
<b>That's an impossible proposition.
This belongs to me now.</b>

19:26.664 --> 19:30.044
<b>Don't touch Siesta with your filthy hands!</b>

19:32.464 --> 19:35.464
<b>Your fist won't reach me.</b>

19:40.764 --> 19:43.264
<b>Where is that rage welling up from?</b>

19:43.264 --> 19:47.814
<b>What's the reason for that spiritual bond
that you both were talking about?</b>

19:47.814 --> 19:51.694
<b>What on earth were you to her?</b>

19:53.904 --> 19:58.904
<b>Hel's asking was immaterial;
I'd been thinking about this all along...</b>

19:58.904 --> 20:06.084
<b>What on earth was I to Siesta?
What did I mean to her?</b>

20:06.084 --> 20:07.494
<b>And yet...</b>

20:09.164 --> 20:12.374
<b>...at this point, I can never know.</b>

20:16.884 --> 20:23.724
<b>Nevertheless... from that day we first
met, 10,000 meters up in the sky,</b>

20:23.724 --> 20:27.224
<b>we continued our travels
over the course of three years.</b>

20:27.224 --> 20:29.974
<b>During those days, which could
never be called tranquil,</b>

20:29.974 --> 20:32.024
<b>my life was in jeopardy countless times.</b>

20:32.024 --> 20:36.694
<b>I was denounced as stupid,
and pushed into absurd situations.</b>

20:36.694 --> 20:43.404
<b>And yet, in the midst of those thousand
absurdities, I laughed 10,000 times.</b>

20:43.404 --> 20:46.124
<b>I laughed together with Siesta.</b>

20:49.584 --> 20:54.794
<b>You ask what the relationship
was between Siesta and me?</b>

20:54.794 --> 20:59.964
<b>You ask me what I thought of Siesta?</b>

20:59.964 --> 21:03.384
<b>I knew that beyond a doubt,
from the beginning,</b>

21:03.384 --> 21:07.764
<b>she was the most important thing
in the whole world to me!</b>

21:18.064 --> 21:20.904
<b>What the...?</b>

21:37.964 --> 21:42.054
<b>Sies... ta...</b>

22:03.074 --> 22:04.994
